ec" 13194139533515 17592186045585 true] [17592186406786 1068 #edb/ref 17592186406779 13194139533515 17592186045585 true] [17592186406786 1068 #edb/ref 17592186406782 13194139533515 17592186045585 true] [17592186406786 1069 "q-181989" 13194139533515 17592186045585 true] [17592186406786 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139533515 17592186045585 true] [17592186406786 1071 "What are the minimum and maximum of the set $A={-8,\\,0,\\,4,\\,-1}?$\n\n$min(A)=$\n\n$-8$\n\n$\\,max(A)=$\n\n$4$" 13194139533515 17592186045585 true] [17592186406786 1072 #uuid "7a8d83c6-dbd1-545a-90aa-30ab2cbbb8f1" 13194139533515 17592186045585 true] [17592186406786 1074 "Recall that \n\n- ${x}_{max}$ is the maximum of a set $S$ if ${x}_{max}\\in S$ and $x\\le {x}_{max}$ for all $x\\in S,$ and\n\n- ${x}_{min}$ is the minimum of a set $S$ if ${x}_{min}\\in S$ and ${x}_{min}\\le x$ for all $x\\in S.$\n\nTherefore, we have the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}min(A) & =min{-8,\\,0,\\,4,\\,-1}=-8 \\\\ max(A) & =max{-8,\\,0,\\,4,\\,-1}=4\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533515 17592186045585 true] [17592186406787 1068 #edb/ref 17592186406783 13194139533515 17592186045585 true] [17592186406787 1069 "q-182007" 13194139533515 17592186045585 true] [17592186406787 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139533515 17592186045585 true] [17592186406787 1071 "Complete the following reasoning about the set $S=(7,\\infty ):$" 13194139533515 17592186045585 true] [17592186406787 1072 #uuid "f612405e-da38-57fe-9f2c-b87a69f932d8" 13194139533515 17592186045585 true] [17592186406787 1074 "Recall that ${x}_{min}$ is the minimum of a set $S$ if \n\n- ${x}_{min}\\in S,$ and\n\n- ${x}_{min}\\le x$ for all $x\\in S.$\n\nIn our case, the value $7$ is not the minimum of the set $S$ because $7\\notin S.$" 13194139533515 17592186045585 true] [17592186406788 1068 #edb/ref 17592186406775 13194139533515 17592186045585 true] [17592186406788 1068 #edb/ref 17592186406777 13194139533515 17592186045585 true] [17592186406788 1069 "q-182027" 13194139533515 17592186045585 true] [17592186406788 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139533515 17592186045585 true] [17592186406788 1071 "What are the minimum and maximum of the set $A=(-2,1)?$" 13194139533515 17592186045585 true] [17592186406788 1072 #uuid "f7921076-6399-562d-b241-b9adcf057407" 13194139533515 17592186045585 true] [17592186406788 1074 "Recall that \n\n- ${x}_{max}$ is the maximum of a set $S$ if ${x}_{max}\\in S$ and $x\\le {x}_{max}$ for all $x\\in S,$ and\n\n- ${x}_{min}$ is the minimum of a set $S$ if ${x}_{min}\\in S$ and ${x}_{min}\\le x$ for all $x\\in S.$\n\nNotice that $-2\\notin A$ and $1\\notin A.$ So, we have the following:\n\n- $min(A)=min(-2,1),$ which $\\text{does not exist}$\n\n- $max(A)=max(-2,1),$ which $\\text{does not exist}$" 13194139533515 17592186045585 true] [17592186406789 1068 #edb/ref 17592186406780 13194139533515 17592186045585 true] [17592186406789 1068 #edb/ref 17592186406781 13194139533515 17592186045585 true] [17592186406789 1069 "q-181993" 13194139533515 17592186045585 true] [17592186406789 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139533515 17592186045585 true] [17592186406789 1071 "What are the minimum and maximum of the set $C={1,\\,-8,\\,7,\\,2}?$\n\n$min(C)=$\n\n$-8$\n\n$\\,max(C)=$\n\n$7$" 13194139533515 17592186045585 true] [17592186406789 1072 #uuid "f87da9b9-2a22-52c7-9a6b-99820a90343e" 13194139533515 17592186045585 true] [17592186406789 1074 "Recall that \n\n- ${x}_{max}$ is the maximum of a set $S$ if ${x}_{max}\\in S$ and $x\\le {x}_{max}$ for all $x\\in S,$ and\n\n- ${x}_{min}$ is the minimum of a set $S$ if ${x}_{min}\\in S$ and ${x}_{min}\\le x$ for all $x\\in S.$\n\nTherefore, we have the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}min(C) & =min{1,\\,-8,\\,7,\\,2}=-8 \\\\ max(C) & =max{1,\\,-8,\\,7,\\,2}=7\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533515 17592186045585 true]] :edb/tempids {"answer-0185113e-67ca-5fea-8414-80405b6d2c88" 17592186406743 "answer-03200264-5c2e-536b-8955-c9e999430ede" 17592186406744 "answer-04c24015-2433-5836-b081